OL,3,CBurnham calls Jason Arday's death a
OL,4,C'tragedy on so many levels'
OL,6,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham has said
OL,7,Fthe death of former Cambridge
OL,8,Fprofessor Jason Arday was "a tragedy
OL,9,Fon so many levels," and it was time
OL,10,Ffor a "moment for reflection".
OL,12,FProf Arday, who resigned after a
OL,13,Fplagiarism row, was pronounced dead
OL,14,Fafter emergency services were called
OL,15,Fto an address in Battersea, south
OL,16,FLondon, on Friday evening following
OL,17,Freports that a man had been found
OL,18,Funresponsive inside a property.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
