FL,309,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30802
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786846703
OL,3,CBurnham calls Jason Arday's death a
OL,4,C'tragedy on so many levels'
OL,6,FHe had told a friend he "couldn't go
OL,7,Fon" hours before his death, after
OL,8,Fbeing subjected to intense scrutiny
OL,9,Fover his academic career.
OL,11,FBurnham told broadcasters during a
OL,12,Fvisit to Cornwall on Saturday: "It's a
OL,13,Ftragedy on so many levels, but
OL,14,Fparticularly just for everybody who
OL,15,Fknew Jason, his family obviously, his
OL,16,Ffriends. We think of think of them
OL,17,Ftoday.
OL,26,@nD@YOUoD@CO]tD@`OU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30803
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786846703
OL,3,CBurnham calls Jason Arday's death a
OL,4,C'tragedy on so many levels'
OL,6,F"It's not a moment for any rushing to
OL,7,Fjudgment. It's a moment for
OL,8,Freflection, I would say, reflecting on
OL,9,Fhow things came to this.
OL,11,F"A really sad, sad and sorry state of
OL,12,Faffairs and I think we all today think
OL,13,Fof Jason, his contribution, and his
OL,14,Ffamily and friends."
OL,16,FThe Metropolitan Police said his death
OL,17,Fis being treated as unexpected, but is
OL,18,Fnot believed to be suspicious.
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@AOUvD@TO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/15
