OL,3,CBurnham calls Jason Arday's death a
OL,4,C'tragedy on so many levels'
OL,6,FUniversity of Cambridge professor and
OL,7,Fdirector of the Autism Research
OL,8,FCentre, Sir Simon Baron-Cohen, told
OL,9,Fthe BBC he spoke to Prof Arday on
OL,10,FFriday morning.
OL,12,FSir Simon told Radio 4's Today
OL,13,Fprogramme: "He was being subjected to
OL,14,Frelentless scrutiny, including
OL,15,Fridicule, discrediting absolutely
OL,16,Fevery detail of his life, and he
OL,17,Fwasn't coping with the loss of his
OL,18,Fcareer, the loss of his reputation,
OL,19,Fand he felt he couldn't go on."
OL,26,@uD@LOU{D@_O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/15
