OL,3,CBurnham calls Jason Arday's death a
OL,4,C'tragedy on so many levels'
OL,6,F"He used those words in voice notes,"
OL,7,Fhe added.
OL,9,FThe family of Mr Arday, who became
OL,10,FCambridge's youngest black professor
OL,11,Fin 2023, said they are "in shock to
OL,12,Fhave lost this amazing father,
OL,13,Fpartner, brother, uncle and son".
OL,26,@nD@AOUnD@eO]sD@XOUuD@`O]
