OL,3,CBurnham calls Jason Arday's death a
OL,4,C'tragedy on so many levels'
OL,6,FIn a statement issued by his
OL,7,Fpublisher, Simon & Schuster UK, they
OL,8,Fsaid: "Jason was subjected to a
OL,9,Fcampaign of sustained abuse for more
OL,10,Fthan three years since he accepted the
OL,11,Frole of professor at Cambridge
OL,12,FUniversity by those who would leave no
OL,13,Fstone unturned in their quest to
OL,14,Fundermine him.
OL,16,F"The campaign of misinformation was
OL,17,Ftoo much for Jason, who was a gentle
OL,18,Fman and who always wanted to see the
OL,19,Fbest in everyone.
OL,26,@pD@GOUxD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/15
