OL,3,CBurnham calls Jason Arday's death a
OL,4,C'tragedy on so many levels'
OL,6,F"We are in shock to have lost this
OL,7,Famazing father, partner, brother,
OL,8,Funcle and son.
OL,10,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,11,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,12,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,13,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,15,F"We won't comment further at this
OL,16,Fpoint beyond asking the press to leave
OL,17,Fus alone now, and to stop the campaign
OL,18,Fof harassment which has been waged
OL,19,Fagainst Jason and his family for too
OL,20,Flong."
OL,26,@nD@AOUwD@AOU|D@FO]
