OL,3,CBurnham calls Jason Arday's death a
OL,4,C'tragedy on so many levels'
OL,6,FMr Arday resigned from his role as a
OL,7,Fprofessor at Cambridge on August 4
OL,8,Ffollowing a plagiarism row.
OL,10,FThe university's Vice-Chancellor,
OL,11,FProfessor Deborah Prentice, said: "We
OL,12,Fare desperately saddened to hear this
OL,13,Ftragic news. Our heartfelt sympathies
OL,14,Fgo to Jason Arday's family and friends
OL,15,Fat this incredibly difficult time."
OL,26,@sD@cOUwD@cO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
