CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786846703
OL,3,CBurnham calls Jason Arday's death a
OL,4,C'tragedy on so many levels'
OL,6,FEducation Secretary Lucy Powell said
OL,7,Fshe was "deeply shocked and saddened
OL,8,Fto hear about the death of Jason
OL,9,FArday" as she urged people to
OL,10,F"remember there are real people with
OL,11,Floved ones involved".
OL,13,FShe wrote on X: "I'm deeply shocked
OL,14,Fand saddened to hear about the death
OL,15,Fof Jason Arday.
OL,17,F"My heartfelt condolences are with his
OL,18,Ffriends and family at this very sad
OL,19,Ftime.
OL,26,@rD@AOUsD@TO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
