OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786846703
OL,3,CBurnham calls Jason Arday's death a
OL,4,C'tragedy on so many levels'
OL,6,F"I urge people to give them privacy
OL,7,Fthrough this incredibly difficult
OL,8,Fperiod & to remember there are real
OL,9,Fpeople with loved ones involved."
OL,11,FJo Maugham, executive director of Good
OL,12,FLaw Project, whose website Mr Arday
OL,13,Fposted a letter on saying he was
OL,14,Fresigning from the University of
OL,15,FCambridge, said Prof Arday's death is
OL,16,F"a tragedy for him and those who loved
OL,17,Fhim".
OL,26,@xD@AOUyD@DO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/15
