OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786846703
OL,3,CBurnham calls Jason Arday's death a
OL,4,C'tragedy on so many levels'
OL,6,FHe added: "Those around him had been
OL,7,Fwarning the media that this was a risk
OL,8,F` it was one reason why I refused to
OL,9,Fjoin those condemning him ` and I do
OL,10,Fnot understand what the public
OL,11,Finterest was in continuing to hound
OL,12,Fhim after he resigned as a professor
OL,13,Fand I do not understand what risk
OL,14,Fassessments media outlets did."
OL,16,FMr Arday, a professor of sociology of
OL,17,Feducation, quit following a series of
OL,18,Fmedia reports alleging he plagiarised
OL,19,Fhis PhD thesis ` completed at
OL,20,FLiverpool John Moores University ` and
OL,21,Fother research.
OL,26,@nD@KOUvD@_O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G11/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30812
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786846703
OL,3,CBurnham calls Jason Arday's death a
OL,4,C'tragedy on so many levels'
OL,6,FFurther questions were asked in the
OL,7,Fpress about the truth of other claims
OL,8,Fhe made, including saying he ran 600
OL,9,Fmiles in six days and that he had
OL,10,Fraised #5.5 million for charity.
OL,12,FAn investigation at Liverpool John
OL,13,FMoores University cleared Mr Arday of
OL,14,Fwrongdoing.
OL,16,FDurham and Glasgow universities are
OL,17,Finvestigating the circumstances around
OL,18,Fhis appointment to academic posts
OL,19,Fthere, and Cambridge's Jesus College
OL,20,Fhas accepted his resignation from his
OL,21,Ffellowship, according to Prof Prentice.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G12/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
