OL,3,CBurnham calls Jason Arday's death a
OL,4,C'tragedy on so many levels'
OL,6,FThe 'campaign of misinformation was
OL,7,Ftoo much for him,' Jason Arday's
OL,8,Ffamily has said, as ITV News' Geraint
OL,9,FVincent reports
OL,11,FMr Arday said in his open resignation
OL,12,Fletter that he felt the "only way to
OL,13,Fbring this chapter to an end is to
OL,14,Fstep away".
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G13/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
