OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786846704
OL,3,CBurnham calls Jason Arday's death a
OL,4,C'tragedy on so many levels'
OL,6,FIn the letter, addressed to colleagues
OL,7,Fand published on the Good Law
OL,8,FProject's website, he said: "This
OL,9,Fdecision should not be interpreted as
OL,10,Fa loss of faith in scholarship or in
OL,11,Fthe values that first brought me to
OL,12,FCambridge.
OL,14,F"Nor should it be mistaken for an
OL,15,Facceptance of the narratives that have
OL,16,Fsurrounded me.
OL,18,F"It is simply the decision of someone
OL,19,Fwho has reached the limits of what any
OL,20,Fperson should reasonably be expected
OL,21,Fto endure."
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G14/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
